cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If referring to this study, please cite the workflow and accompanying technical report."
type: software
version: 1.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-27"
license: MIT
title: "Axial Turbine Stage 2D CFD with PyFluent"
abstract: >-
  A transient planar stator-rotor CFD workflow using ANSYS Fluent and PyFluent,
  with preserved historical reference data, fixed-topology baseline comparisons,
  three systematic meshes, original-position Hybrid Initialization,
  cycle-resolved numerical sensitivity checks and fixed-scale Mach visualisation.
authors:
  - family-names: Proli
    given-names: Lorenzo
repository-code: "https://github.com/lorenzoproli/axial-turbine-stage-2d-cfd-pyfluent"
keywords:
  - computational fluid dynamics
  - axial turbine
  - rotor-stator interaction
  - PyFluent
  - sliding mesh
  - unsteady RANS
  - numerical verification
